Modifications
-------------
The Modelfile in this repository does not modify model weights. It adds:
  - a system prompt describing a Chinese-language Japanese yuri light-novel
    writing style (see SYSTEM.md and the SYSTEM block in Modelfile);
  - sampling parameters (temperature, top_p, top_k, repeat_penalty, num_ctx).

The resulting local model is named "yuri-qwen" and remains subject to the
Apache License 2.0.

Training material disclosure
----------------------------
The writing-style rules were distilled from style analysis of Chinese
translations of the following Japanese yuri light novels:

  - 《安达与岛村》 by 入间人间 (Hitoma Iruma)
  - 《我的初恋对象与人接吻了》 by 入间人间 (Hitoma Iruma)
  - 《人妻教师与班上女高中生陷入爱恋》 by 入间人间 (Hitoma Iruma)
  - 《我买下了与她的每周密会～以五千圆为借口，共度两人时光～》
    (also translated as 《一周一次买下同班同学的那些事》)

The original novel texts are NOT included in and are NOT distributed with
this repository. Copyright in those works belongs to their respective
authors, translators, publishers, and other rights holders. This project
only abstracts general writing techniques and stylistic features.

